<title>FRANCE: IBCA assigns AAA rating to RATP long-term debt.</title>
<headline>IBCA assigns AAA rating to RATP long-term debt.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>European credit rating agency IBCA said on Tuesday it had assigned a AAA rating to long-term debt issued by RATP, the state-owned company which runs the Paris rail network.</p>
<p>IBCA said in a statement it had assigned an A1 plus rating to RATP's short-term debt.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
